    "label": "Lives lost on the Titanic",
    "big": "1,500+",
    "sub": "15 April 1912"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Joughin was hanging on at the very back of the ship as it went down. He rode it down almost like an elevator.",
   "show": {
    "k": "scene",
    "bg": "titanic",
    "cast": [
